=== Serial communication protocol standard (current implementation) / 串口通讯协议标准（当前实现） ===

Incoming command from host to controller / 上位机发给控制器的指令：
- Format / 格式：T,<a1_target>,<a2_target>,<a3_target>,<a4_target>
- Example / 示例：T,100,200,300,400
- Rules / 规则：
  - Must start with T, / 必须以 T, 开头
  - Must contain exactly 4 integer target values / 必须包含 4 个整数目标值
  - Values must be separated by commas / 数值之间用英文逗号分隔
  - Each value must be between 0 and 1023 / 每个数值范围为 0 到 1023
  - No extra characters are allowed / 不允许有额外字符
  - Line ending is newline; carriage return is ignored / 行结束使用换行符，回车会被忽略

Telemetry response from controller to host / 控制器发给上位机的状态反馈：
- Format / 格式：single-line JSON
- Example / 示例：
  {"a1_current":123,"a1_target":100,"a2_current":456,"a2_target":200,"a3_current":789,"a3_target":300,"a4_current":321,"a4_target":400}
- Notes / 说明：
  - The controller sends current positions and target positions for all 4 axes / 控制器会发送 4 轴的当前值和目标值
  - Each message is terminated with a newline / 每条消息以换行符结束

Error response standard / 错误响应标准：
- Format / 格式：{"error":"<error_code>"}
- Example / 示例：{"error":"invalid_command"}
- Common error codes / 常见错误码：
  - empty_message / 空消息
  - invalid_command / 无效指令格式
  - input_overflow / 输入缓存溢出

Parsing and error handling rules / 解析与报错规则：
- Empty line -> return empty_message / 空行 -> 返回 empty_message
- Wrong prefix, wrong number of values, non-numeric values, out-of-range values, or extra characters -> return invalid_command / 前缀错误、值个数错误、非数字、超出范围、额外字符 -> 返回 invalid_command
- Buffer overflow while receiving serial data -> return input_overflow / 串口接收缓存溢出 -> 返回 input_overflow
- Valid command -> apply new targets and send telemetry / 合法指令 -> 更新目标值并返回遥测数据


